  "id": "totals_mismatch_capture_reduces_authorized",
  "title": "A capture does not reduce authorized",
  "test_plan_vector": null,
  "spec": [
    "Platform Verification 5: MUST recompute `authorized`, `captured` and `refunded` for each chain from the `succeeded` events it holds, per Running Totals, and MUST check that `totals.mandated` equals the `payment_amount` of the Payment Mandate that `mandate_ref` covers. A receipt whose stated `totals` differ from these values is `receipt_totals_mismatch`.",
    "Running Totals: `totals.mandated` is the `payment_amount` of the Payment Mandate that `mandate_ref` covers. The other totals start at 0 and change only on `succeeded` events: `authorization` and `authorization_adjustment` add to `authorized`, `release` subtracts from it, `capture` adds to `captured`, `capture_reversal` subtracts from it, `refund` adds to `refunded`. A capture does not reduce `authorized`."
  ],
